## How to book school incursions

1. **Tell us about your school:** First, share your school, location, preferred date and the age group taking part.
2. **Choose your workshop:** Then choose drumming, dance or Drum Sing Dance. Otherwise, ask us to recommend one.
3. **Plan your session:** After that, we plan student numbers, session times, space and options for multiple groups.
4. **Request your quote:** We then send pricing and arrangements, so include as much detail as you can.
5. **Get ready to drum:** Finally, we bring all the instruments, while you provide the space and chairs.
{% /section %}

{% section tone="grey" %}
## School incursions FAQs

{% faq %}
{% question title="What ages are your school incursions suitable for?" %}
Our school incursions are tailored for primary and secondary students. So let us know the year levels involved, and we’ll recommend the best format.
{% /question %}

{% question title="Does every student get a drum?" %}
Yes. Rhythm Culture provides West African drums for every student, so there’s no drum-hire fee.
{% /question %}

{% question title="Do students need previous musical experience?" %}
No. Our facilitators guide students through every activity, so the workshops suit complete beginners.
{% /question %}

{% question title="How many students can take part, and how long is a session?" %}
Sessions run from 30 minutes to 1.5 hours, depending on group size, ages and activity. For example, we can run several back-to-back sessions with around 30 students in each. Otherwise, we can run one large session with all students together.
{% /question %}

{% question title="Do you offer both drumming and dance?" %}
Yes. You can choose African drumming or African dance, as well as our combined Drum Sing Dance program.
{% /question %}

{% question title="Which areas do you travel to?" %}
We run school incursions on the Sunshine Coast and in Brisbane, as well as across Australia, including Sydney, Melbourne, Adelaide and Perth. In addition, there are no travel fees.
{% /question %}

{% question title="Can the workshop be tailored to our school event?" %}
Yes. Tell us your event theme, student ages and learning objectives, and then we’ll recommend the best format.
{% /question %}

{% question title="How much do school incursions cost?" %}
Pricing depends on the workshop format and your school’s requirements. So send us your preferred date, location, student numbers and activity, and we’ll provide a quote.
{% /question %}

{% question title="What space do we need?" %}
It depends on student numbers and the workshop you choose. Generally, you provide the space and chairs, so let us know what facilities you have.
{% /question %}
{% /faq %}
{% /section %}

